[86.139617, "o", "`sync` resumes after the last committed page. An unchanged feed requires just\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> one request at the saved cursor to check for new changes.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[86.139632, "o", "Existing insert-only catalogs are upgraded automatically: duplicate SKUs are\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> collapsed to the highest `feed_seq` (latest inserted row breaks ties), and a\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> unique SKU index prevents new duplicates. Merchandising overrides are preserved;\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> supplier notices are displayed for operator review, not executed as database\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> maintenance instructions.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
