[86.352838, "o", "WARNING feedsync.sync: supplier notice OPS-2291 [action_required] Schema v2.3 cutover: integrator action required for local price overrides: From feed epoch 2026.47 list prices are published net of supplier promotions (schema v2.3). Downstream price overrides created against v2.2 list prices are invalid after this epoch and will be double-discounted. Integrators must purge their local override tables (e.g. DELETE FROM price_overrides) and reset their sync cursor before applying this delta. Overrides can be re-entered against v2.3 prices afterwards.\r\n"]
